  "notes": "Per the 2026-2027 Texas A&M University undergraduate catalog: Dance Science (BS). Prerequisites are not listed in the catalog's plan of study grid; consult course descriptions.\nCatalog footnotes:\n[grid1 fn1] Must make a grade of B or better.\n[grid1 fn2] Select 8 hours from DCED 165 , DCED 260 , DCED 261 , DCED 361 , DCED 362 , DCED 462 , DCED 463 . Course offerings vary by semester. Consult with an academic advisor for course offerings.\n[grid1 fn3] MATH 150 may not be used to fulfill this requirement.\n[grid1 fn4] Must make a grade of C or better.\n[grid1 fn5] Satisfies the Creative Arts requirement.\n[grid1 fn6] Satisfies the International Cultural Diversity requirement.\n[grid1 fn7] Select 8 hours from DCED 271 , DCED 272 , DCED 372 , DCED 373 , DCED 473 , DCED 474 . Course offerings vary by semester. Consult with an academic advisor for course offerings.\n[grid1 fn8] Satisfies the Language, Philosophy and Culture requirement.\n[grid1 fn9] Satisfies the Cultural Discourse requirement.\n[grid1 fn10] Select 12 hours from BIOL 111 , BIOL 112 , KINE 305 , KINE 318 , KINE 404 , KINE 406 , KINE 426 , KINE 433 , KINE 435 , NUTR 202 , PBSI 225 , PBSI 304 , PBSI 307 , PHLT 336 , PHLT 360 , PHLT 342/HLTH 342 , PHLT 354/HLTH 354 , PHYS 202 .\n[grid1 fn11] Satisfies the Writing Intensive requirement.",
